      "id": "col1b",
      "x": 70,
      "y": 165,
      "text": "Cold email infrastructure\n\u2014 3\u20135 sending domains\n\u2014 SPF / DKIM / DMARC\n\u2014 21-day warmup protocol\n\nClay waterfall enrichment\n\u2014 Apollo \u2192 Hunter \u2192 verify\n\u2014 Company data overlay\n\u2014 80\u201390% contact coverage\n\nProgrammatic SEO\n\u2014 Next.js dynamic routes\n\u2014 AI citation structure\n\u2014 Comparison / alt pages",
