    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "col2b",
      "x": 450,
      "y": 165,
      "text": "PostHog event taxonomy\n\u2014 Signup \u2192 aha moment funnel\n\u2014 Cohort A vs B analysis\n\u2014 Drop-off identification\n\nPQL scoring\n\u2014 In-app behavior threshold\n\u2014 Conversion correlation\n\u2014 Automated Slack alerts\n\nn8n behavioral triggers\n\u2014 Stall detected \u2192 4hr email\n\u2014 Loom walkthrough delivery\n\u2014 Booking link at 72hrs",
