      "text": "Customer health scoring\n\u2014 Login freq + feature use\n\u2014 Support ticket volume\n\u2014 Churn-risk alerts\n\nPricing infrastructure\n\u2014 Usage tracking in Stripe\n\u2014 Expansion triggers\n\u2014 Dunning + smart retry\n\nHubSpot CRM backbone\n\u2014 Pipeline from every tool\n\u2014 Attribution connected\n\u2014 Single source of truth",
